      <h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Data Centre</h1>
      <p>Modern data centre infrastructure demands power efficiency, scalability, and uncompromising resilience. MEAICON designs and manages data centre solutions from Tier II to Tier IV, including colocation strategy, hybrid cloud integration, DCIM platforms, and edge deployments.</p>
      <p>We help organisations across the MEA region build and operate facilities that meet international standards while accommodating local conditions and growth trajectories.</p>
