          <h2 class="section-title">Resilient infrastructure for critical workloads</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>MEAICON approaches data centre design as a holistic discipline — balancing power, cooling, connectivity, security, and space planning. We assess your workload requirements, growth projections, and compliance obligations to recommend the right tier classification, whether that means a Tier II facility for standard enterprise needs or a Tier IV design for mission-critical operations.</p>
          <p>Beyond the physical facility, we integrate DCIM platforms that give you real-time visibility into power usage, thermal conditions, and capacity utilisation. For organisations adopting hybrid models, we architect seamless integration between on-premises facilities and cloud environments, and we design edge deployments that bring compute closer to your users and data sources.</p>
