        <div class="prose-content">
          <p>We help clients improve energy efficiency and optimise operating costs by applying best practices in data centre design, airflow management, equipment selection, and system integration. The goal is infrastructure that delivers strong performance while minimising waste — measured in PUE, energy consumption, and operational expenditure.</p>
          <p>Budget management is integrated into the design process. We support clients in balancing capital and operational expenditure, validating vendor proposals, and ensuring that budget decisions align with long-term resilience and scalability objectives. A facility that is cheap to build but expensive to operate is not a good investment — we help you see the full picture.</p>
        </div>
